      "id": "overdue-001",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Overdue reminders\nRuns daily. The signed **Run now** webhook starts the same path on demand.\n\nEach loan is **claimed in Convex before sending**, under a key of `loan id + date`. A retried run gets `claimed: false` and sends nothing, so nobody is reminded twice in a day. Tomorrow's key is the retry for an unknown outcome.\n\nLoans run one at a time so one failure cannot stop the rest. If any failed, the run ends red and the error workflow reports it.",
        "width": 1780,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "overdue-002",
      "name": "Every day at 09:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 9,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
